<title>HONG KONG: HK observatory reports earthquake near Okinawa.</title>
<headline>HK observatory reports earthquake near Okinawa.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>An intense earthquake estimated at 5.4 on the Richter scale was detected south of the Japanese island of Okinawa on Friday, the Royal Hong Kong Observatory said.</p>
<p>The quake, recorded at 1.08 a.m. (1708 GMT on Thursday), was located in the region of the Ryukyu Islands about 90 km (55 miles) south of Okinawa, it said.</p>
